        {
          "text": " baatuma, baiha Yeremia omu kibuga ky'abarinzi, baamukwatsa Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, ngu amugarure omu ka ye. Atyo ku yaahikireyo, yaatuura omu bantu baayo.",
